<title>HONG KONG: Wheelock to sell 20 Parc Regal flats.</title>
<headline>Wheelock to sell 20 Parc Regal flats.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based Wheelock Properties said on Tuesday it would put on sale on Wednesday 20 flats at its Parc Regal luxury residential development in Homantin Hill.</p>
<p>The units from tower 2, ranging from 853 to 1,000 square feet, would be offered starting from HK$7,145 per square foot.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
